Value Required interface ([A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9-]*\d[\d/.]*)
Value line_status (.+?)
Value protocol_status (.+?)
Value description (.*)
Value hw_address (\S+)
Value bandwidth_kbps (\d+)
Value speed (.+?)
Value duplex (.+?)
Value port_link_type (.+?)
Value vlan_native (\d+)
Value mtu (\d+)
Value l2mtu (\d+)
Value input_packets (\d+)
Value output_packets (\d+)
Value input_bytes (\d+)
Value output_bytes (\d+)
Value input_errors (\d+)
Value output_errors (\d+)
Value input_crc_errors (\d+)
Value last_physical_up_time (.+?)
Value last_physical_down_time (.+?)
Value negotiation (.+?)
Value port_mode (.+?)
Value loopback (.+?)

Start
  ^[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9-]*\d[\d/.]*(?:\s+current state\s*:.*)?\s*$$ -> Continue.Record
  ^${interface}\s+current state\s*:\s*${line_status}\s*$$
  ^${interface}\s*$$
  ^\s*Current state:\s*${line_status}\s*$$
  ^\s*Line protocol (?:current )?state\s*:\s*${protocol_status}\s*$$
  ^\s*Description:\s*${description}\s*$$
  ^\s*Bandwidth:\s*${bandwidth_kbps}\s+kbps\s*$$
  ^\s*Maximum transmission unit:\s*${mtu}\s*(?:bytes)?\s*$$
  ^\s*Maximum frame length:\s*${l2mtu}\s*(?:bytes)?\s*$$
  ^\s*IP packet frame type:.*hardware address:\s*${hw_address}\s*$$
  ^\s*IP Sending Frames.*Hardware address is\s*${hw_address}\s*$$
  ^\s*PVID:\s*${vlan_native}(?:,.*The Maximum Frame Length is\s+${l2mtu})?\s*$$
  ^\s*Port link-type:\s*${port_link_type}\s*$$
  ^\s*\S+ Port, Link-type\s*:\s*${port_link_type},\s*$$
  ^\s*${speed}\s+mode,\s*${duplex}\s+mode\s*$$
  ^\s*Speed\s*:\s*${speed},\s*Loopback:\s*${loopback}\s*$$
  ^\s*Duplex:\s*${duplex},\s*Negotiation:\s*${negotiation}\s*$$
  ^\s*Port Mode:\s*${port_mode}\s*$$
  ^\s*Last physical up time\s*:\s*${last_physical_up_time}\s*$$
  ^\s*Last physical down time\s*:\s*${last_physical_down_time}\s*$$
  ^\s*Input \(total\):\s*${input_packets}\s+packets,\s*${input_bytes}\s+bytes.*$$
  ^\s*Output \(total\):\s*${output_packets}\s+packets,\s*${output_bytes}\s+bytes.*$$
  ^\s*Input:\s*${input_errors}\s+input errors.*$$
  ^\s*Output:\s*${output_errors}\s+output errors.*$$ -> Record Tail
  ^\s*${input_crc_errors}\s+CRC,.*$$
  ^\s*Input:\s*${input_packets}\s+packets,\s*${input_bytes}\s+bytes(?:,\s*\d+\s+drops)?\s*$$ -> Input
  ^\s*Output:\s*${output_packets}\s+packets,\s*${output_bytes}\s+bytes(?:,\s*\d+\s+drops)?\s*$$ -> Output

Tail
  ^${interface}\s+current state\s*:\s*${line_status}\s*$$ -> Start
  ^${interface}\s*$$ -> Start

Input
  ^\s*Total Error:\s*${input_errors}\s*$$
  ^\s*CRC:\s*${input_crc_errors},.*$$
  ^\s*Output:\s*${output_packets}\s+packets,\s*${output_bytes}\s+bytes(?:,\s*\d+\s+drops)?\s*$$ -> Output
  ^[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9-]*\d[\d/.]*(?:\s+current state\s*:.*)?\s*$$ -> Continue.Record
  ^${interface}\s+current state\s*:\s*${line_status}\s*$$ -> Start
  ^${interface}\s*$$ -> Start

Output
  ^\s*Total Error:\s*${output_errors}\s*$$
  ^[A-Za-z0-9][A-Za-z0-9-]*\d[\d/.]*(?:\s+current state\s*:.*)?\s*$$ -> Continue.Record
  ^${interface}\s+current state\s*:\s*${line_status}\s*$$ -> Start
  ^${interface}\s*$$ -> Start
